The GRETIL texts are (C) Copyright the Pali Text Society and the Dhammakaya Foundation, 2015,
distributed by GRETIL under CC BY-SA 4.0. corrections.json and the built files in corrected/
derive from those texts and are released under the same licence. build.py and README.md contain
no GRETIL text and are released under the same licence.

Proofreading and approval of the corrections: Jorge Contreras (github.com/jorgecaa), foureditions
project. The PTS corrections marked but not applied in the built files are those of the authorities cited there.
The proofreader is not a philologist. The corrections are mechanical: each one restores what the printed PTS edition prints, read on its scan, or records a correction published by the authority cited. No reading was chosen on text-critical grounds, and no emendation is the proofreader's own; listing an emendation does not endorse it.
